85
05:01.230 --> 05:02.640
How long will you keep being the good guy?

86
05:02.910 --> 05:03.800
Wanna consider monkhood?

87
05:05.670 --> 05:07.760
I don't wanna be the good guy either, View.

88
05:08.490 --> 05:10.960
I wanna be as shitty to him as he was to me.

89
05:11.110 --> 05:11.810
Yeah.

90
05:11.830 --> 05:13.120
Go on. Have at it.

91
05:13.140 --> 05:14.120
Don't think any further.

92
05:15.730 --> 05:17.160
How would I be any different from him?

93
05:22.420 --> 05:25.320
Going back home, I've seen so many things.

94
05:25.920 --> 05:27.640
I saw Dad and Mom

95
05:27.660 --> 05:30.480
waking up early to help each other make noodle soup

96
05:30.830 --> 05:32.520
and work.

97
05:34.240 --> 05:35.920
They bickered sometimes,

98
05:36.110 --> 05:37.360
they fought sometimes.

99
05:38.810 --> 05:40.630
After a little while, they teased each other again,

100
05:42.570 --> 05:44.000
laughed together,

101
05:46.620 --> 05:48.120
watched TV,

102
05:49.420 --> 05:50.680
and went upstairs to bed.

103
05:55.280 --> 05:56.420
That got me thinking

104
05:57.520 --> 05:59.310
that everything we're doing,

105
06:00.510 --> 06:03.600
clawing our way to the top

106
06:04.330 --> 06:05.960
while stepping on people's heads,

107
06:06.630 --> 06:08.020
hurting them,

108
06:09.330 --> 06:12.480
not even knowing where the top ends,

109
06:14.640 --> 06:16.120
what is all of it for?

110
06:24.620 --> 06:25.580
I believe that...

111
06:26.320 --> 06:28.820
no one wants to stay up there all the time, View.

112
06:31.300 --> 06:32.520
Not even Nine.

113
06:33.830 --> 06:34.830
Mm.

114
06:37.340 --> 06:38.280
So, which temple?

115
06:40.320 --> 06:40.960
Huh?

116
06:41.420 --> 06:42.580
Which temple will you get ordained at?

117
06:42.600 --> 06:43.680
I'll invite the guests.

118
06:57.850 --> 06:58.510
Wan.

119
07:01.320 --> 07:02.930
I know what you're gonna say.

120
07:04.830 --> 07:06.040
I have my answer.

121
07:08.120 --> 07:09.200
Wan's getting ordained.

122
07:09.220 --> 07:09.920
Huh?!

123
07:11.260 --> 07:12.320
I'm not.

124
07:17.320 --> 07:18.720
I'm having a word with Nine first.

125
07:19.120 --> 07:19.840
Huh?!

126
07:23.320 --> 07:24.520
Want me to come with?

127
07:26.310 --> 07:27.350
It's fine.

128
07:28.530 --> 07:29.960
I have to do this alone.

129
07:30.380 --> 07:31.310
Wait.

130
07:31.330 --> 07:33.360
First, tell me what you're talking to him about.

131
07:33.730 --> 07:34.630
I know.

132
07:34.920 --> 07:36.210
Huh? But how?

133
07:37.010 --> 07:37.760
Third,

134
07:38.320 --> 07:40.600
I want everyone to wait. Hold everything off for now.

135
07:41.610 --> 07:43.430
Can you talk to them?

136
07:44.820 --> 07:45.920
What if it doesn't work out?

137
07:55.100 --> 07:55.920
It's fine.

138
07:57.120 --> 07:59.120
Let it play out.

139
08:04.000 --> 08:04.710
Ugh!

140
08:04.730 --> 08:06.320
Are you communicating telepathically?

141
08:06.340 --> 08:07.840
Just tell me your plan, Wan.

142
08:37.880 --> 08:40.679
[Juno.Jn: Do you miss me?]

143
08:40.700 --> 08:42.000
[Do you miss me?]

144
08:42.020 --> 08:43.320
[I'm back,]

145
08:43.340 --> 08:45.760
[You secondary fucking couple]

146
08:53.130 --> 08:54.020
Nine.

147
08:56.160 --> 08:57.880
You have to take care of this for me, Pitch.

148
08:58.560 --> 08:59.400
What happened?

149
09:02.410 --> 09:03.820
That damn Juno sent me a threat.

150
09:05.280 --> 09:06.440
Why would he do that?

151
09:06.960 --> 09:08.720
And why now?

152
09:08.740 --> 09:09.880
Like, I don't care

153
09:09.900 --> 09:12.240
what kind of sneaky plot he's up to,

154
09:12.260 --> 09:13.820
but you have to take care of him.

155
09:13.840 --> 09:15.040
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

156
09:15.220 --> 09:16.560
How do you expect me to?

157
09:16.920 --> 09:18.310
You want me to hire a hitman to shoot him?

158
09:18.330 --> 09:19.160
Can you?!

159
09:19.320 --> 09:20.320
Whoa, Nine!

160
09:20.820 --> 09:22.360
You want me to take care of him

161
09:22.390 --> 09:24.240
just because you two don't get along?

162
09:24.520 --> 09:25.680
He already left the industry.

163
09:25.710 --> 09:27.080
There's nothing he can do.

164
09:28.390 --> 09:29.600
And aren't you gonna do shit?!

165
09:29.630 --> 09:31.430
Hey, how could you say that?!

166
09:31.800 --> 09:32.630
Nine,

167
09:32.650 --> 09:33.440
stop.

168
09:34.380 --> 09:35.520
What's the problem between you two?

169
09:35.790 --> 09:36.900
Tell me.

170
09:36.920 --> 09:37.910
Don't leave out a single thing.

171
09:37.930 --> 09:39.220
What did you do to him?

172
09:39.910 --> 09:40.990
Nothing.

173
09:41.730 --> 09:42.990
It was a long time ago.

174
09:43.020 --> 09:43.840
They got into a fight.

175
09:44.320 --> 09:45.820
They exchanged words. It's just...

176
09:46.930 --> 09:48.440
Nine's been stressed out lately,

177
09:48.570 --> 09:50.000
so he's paranoid about everything. You know it.

178
09:50.580 --> 09:51.280
Nothing?

179
09:51.300 --> 09:52.600
Not what he said, it's not!

180
09:53.560 --> 09:54.940
Please don't hold it against him.

181
09:56.620 --> 09:58.280
Apologize to Pitch, now.

182
09:59.720 --> 10:00.440
Quick.

183
10:04.720 --> 10:05.610
Sorry...

184
10:06.620 --> 10:07.320
Pitch.

185
10:20.920 --> 10:22.360
Let me make it clear

186
10:22.670 --> 10:25.160
that if any fucking scandal I don't know about

187
10:25.410 --> 10:28.480
turns up while I'm working with them,

188
10:28.730 --> 10:30.010
mark my words,

189
10:30.030 --> 10:33.440
I'm not keeping your asses around!

190
10:35.120 --> 10:35.800
Yes, Pitch.

191
10:40.720 --> 10:41.600
Alright.

192
11:00.010 --> 11:01.900
They gave us a green light for the press conference.

193
11:05.220 --> 11:06.160
Really?

194
11:07.420 --> 11:08.230
Yes.

195
11:11.230 --> 11:12.320
Get yourself ready.

196
11:13.730 --> 11:15.760
We'll hold a big press conference soon.

197
11:16.900 --> 11:18.250
Wan, Wan!

198
11:18.830 --> 11:19.610
Look,

199
11:19.630 --> 11:20.600
have you seen this?

200
11:21.430 --> 11:23.600
Nine's big press conference.

201
11:23.770 --> 11:25.040
Brace yourself.

202
11:27.550 --> 11:29.800
"VE Entertainment

203
11:29.930 --> 11:33.010
would like to congratulate Nine Nopphanat,

204
11:33.030 --> 11:34.320
an artist under the company

205
11:34.620 --> 11:37.280
who is about to step into an important role

206
11:37.300 --> 11:40.040
in his international acting career path.

207
11:40.560 --> 11:44.160
Therefore, we would like to invite the press and the fans to participate."

208
11:47.420 --> 11:49.840
I keep every single one of my words.

209
11:50.320 --> 11:51.880
I suggest you do the same.

210
11:58.730 --> 11:59.530
Damn,

211
12:00.420 --> 12:03.200
does one need a press conference to announce going international?

212
12:03.400 --> 12:04.330
The hype is insane!

213
12:04.350 --> 12:06.410
I thought he was receiving an Oscar.

214
12:07.110 --> 12:07.900
Hey,

215
12:07.920 --> 12:10.320
don't scream, or I'll smack you in the mouth.

216
12:17.380 --> 12:18.720
When's the event?

217
12:21.110 --> 12:21.800
Well...

218
12:22.130 --> 12:24.160
in three days, it seems.

219
12:31.110 --> 12:31.600
Hey,

220
12:32.400 --> 12:33.500
don't tell me

221
12:33.520 --> 12:34.990
that you're going to see Nine.

222
12:36.160 --> 12:38.920
Ugh! The whole thing is about to end, but the stupidity continues.

223
12:53.200 --> 12:54.710
[Guys, is it that project? He's killing it;

224
12:54.730 --> 12:55.860
you've taken the next step,

225
12:55.880 --> 12:57.010
truly the pride of our country #Ninenw]

226
12:57.030 --> 12:58.940
[I've seen Nine since one of the first steps he took,

227
12:58.960 --> 13:01.210
so I'm gonna get my hopes up and be happy]

228
13:01.230 --> 13:02.740
[Nine's skills are no joke, and that's what caught their eye;

229
13:02.760 --> 13:05.240
please adore him and stay tuned for his first international project]

230
13:05.260 --> 13:07.110
[My favorite series and my favorite actor, dude]

231
13:07.130 --> 13:12.440
[#Ninenw]

232
13:27.600 --> 13:30.000
[I got a lead]

233
13:37.040 --> 13:39.100
[I got a lead]

234
13:41.470 --> 13:42.520
