235
14:04.120 --> 14:04.880
Mama,

236
14:05.120 --> 14:06.830
I found the people who are going after me.

237
14:07.920 --> 14:10.120
Mama, look at the photo I sent you.

238
14:10.140 --> 14:12.060
The photo? Give me a sec.

239
14:13.560 --> 14:15.760
That's Juno and Rin.

240
14:15.780 --> 14:17.920
And who's that woman?

241
14:18.350 --> 14:19.940
The owner of the account "doyouseemenine."

242
14:19.960 --> 14:21.960
Huh? How did you know that?

243
14:22.740 --> 14:24.580
Well, she came to me at the hotel that night!

244
14:24.600 --> 14:26.960
Bastard, why didn't you tell me?!

245
14:27.070 --> 14:27.980
That doesn't matter, Mama.

246
14:28.000 --> 14:29.160
Right now...

247
14:29.550 --> 14:30.440
we know

248
14:30.710 --> 14:32.420
who betrayed me.

249
14:33.620 --> 14:35.220
You screwed me over.

250
14:35.930 --> 14:37.080
I'm gonna fucking take you out.

251
14:50.810 --> 14:52.410
I'm on my way, Cher.

252
14:53.820 --> 14:54.420
Alright.

253
14:55.870 --> 14:57.070
Let me give you a ride.

254
15:08.730 --> 15:09.910
What are you gonna do?

255
15:12.330 --> 15:13.820
What are you gonna say to him?

256
15:19.450 --> 15:21.840
To me, I'm only asking that he tells the truth.

257
15:23.330 --> 15:26.210
As long as he says I didn't shove him into the pool, I'll be fine.

258
15:30.470 --> 15:32.490
Explaining things to those who hate you

259
15:34.210 --> 15:35.360
is never a success.

260
15:35.930 --> 15:36.930
I've been there.

261
15:38.630 --> 15:39.630
I know.

262
15:42.430 --> 15:44.800
I'm not expecting it to be a success or anything.

263
15:46.220 --> 15:48.040
I just wanna be selfish for a change.

264
15:49.310 --> 15:51.710
If he refuses to do as I say after I tell him,

265
15:52.270 --> 15:53.630
I won't feel guilty.

266
15:57.620 --> 15:59.210
What if he hurts you?

267
16:03.930 --> 16:05.120
Don't worry about me.

268
16:05.970 --> 16:07.220
I can take care of myself.

269
16:08.930 --> 16:10.680
If he really does hurt me this time,

270
16:12.030 --> 16:13.080
I'll fight.

271
16:16.300 --> 16:17.600
Please let me come with you.

272
16:19.020 --> 16:19.770
It's okay.

273
16:19.790 --> 16:20.980
I'll be with Cher.

274
16:22.920 --> 16:23.730
As for you,

275
16:24.100 --> 16:25.400
go be with Juno.

276
16:27.520 --> 16:29.240
If Nine actually agreed,

277
16:29.260 --> 16:30.560
I'm worried that...

278
16:31.420 --> 16:33.600
Juno wouldn't wanna drop it.

279
16:39.280 --> 16:40.520
I trust you.

280
16:43.680 --> 16:46.000
And I want you to trust me, too.

281
16:49.320 --> 16:50.500
I'm scared.

282
17:02.430 --> 17:03.720
I am, too.

283
17:05.430 --> 17:07.520
I know it's stupid of me to do this,

284
17:08.530 --> 17:10.400
but it's probably the last thing

285
17:10.839 --> 17:13.400
I can at least do for him as his fan.

286
17:37.930 --> 17:38.730
Nine,

287
17:39.650 --> 17:42.680
after the press conference, you're taking a group photo like always.

288
17:42.930 --> 17:44.140
Be on standby.

289
17:44.420 --> 17:45.040
Okay.

290
17:48.130 --> 17:50.910
Hi there, peeps!

291
17:50.930 --> 17:52.730
Hi, hi.

292
17:57.540 --> 17:58.200
Oh?

293
17:58.220 --> 17:59.090
Toto,

294
17:59.110 --> 18:00.310
why the hell are you here?

295
18:00.340 --> 18:00.760
Get out!

296
18:00.780 --> 18:01.800
No, why are you here?

297
18:03.400 --> 18:04.280
Get out.

298
18:04.760 --> 18:05.690
Oh, well...

299
18:05.710 --> 18:06.680
I am...

300
18:06.990 --> 18:09.400
your hairstylist. I'm here to do your hair, of course.

301
18:09.530 --> 18:11.800
Jeez, I was only a bit late,

302
18:11.820 --> 18:13.340
and you went that far to tease me.

303
18:13.360 --> 18:14.200
Come on.

304
18:14.220 --> 18:15.490
Toto, move!

305
18:30.030 --> 18:33.200
I just went out for a meal with Juno.

306
18:33.230 --> 18:35.200
I didn't talk or gossip about you one bit.

307
18:36.920 --> 18:39.130
Toto, sweetie, go wait in the other room.

308
18:39.150 --> 18:40.450
Let them talk it out, alright?

309
18:40.470 --> 18:41.230
No need.

310
18:42.320 --> 18:43.340
Stay here.

311
18:46.660 --> 18:47.720
Don't lie.

312
18:48.200 --> 18:50.520
This isn't just about you going out to eat with that damn Juno.

313
18:51.220 --> 18:53.630
Are you saying you don't know the woman in that photo?

314
18:53.650 --> 18:54.480
Hm?

315
18:57.530 --> 18:58.310
Uh...

316
18:58.330 --> 19:00.030
Who is she anyway?

317
19:01.530 --> 19:03.680
It's the owner of the account "doyouseemenine."

318
19:04.920 --> 19:05.400
Huh?

319
19:06.110 --> 19:07.110
What did you say?

320
19:07.710 --> 19:08.610
Nine,

321
19:09.950 --> 19:11.800
I didn't do it. I swear.

322
19:16.740 --> 19:18.720
What am I gonna do with you, Rin?

323
19:22.110 --> 19:24.500
I just had a meal with that damn Juno...

324
19:24.520 --> 19:26.930
Like I told you, it was just a meal.

325
19:26.950 --> 19:27.640
And...

326
19:27.760 --> 19:29.940
he brought someone random. I didn't even know who she was...

327
19:29.960 --> 19:31.040
Bullshit!

328
19:34.220 --> 19:36.440
I don't think you can stay in this career anymore.

329
19:37.800 --> 19:39.030
Or even if you could,

330
19:40.080 --> 19:41.520
I doubt it'd be in this industry.

331
19:42.010 --> 19:44.320
Maybe you could go back to doing university cheerleaders' hair again?

332
19:44.430 --> 19:46.020
Right, Susan?

333
19:46.680 --> 19:47.640
Uh...

334
19:51.040 --> 19:51.880
I'm sorry.

335
19:53.410 --> 19:54.840
I'm sorry...

336
19:55.090 --> 19:56.770
If you want, I can stop talking, contacting,

337
19:56.790 --> 19:58.090
or even cut him loose entirely.

338
19:58.110 --> 20:00.320
But...could you give me a chance?

339
20:00.530 --> 20:02.020
I'm sorry. Please give me a chance.

340
20:02.040 --> 20:02.920
I can...

341
20:03.130 --> 20:05.000
I can even bow at your feet.

342
20:13.420 --> 20:14.230
Go on.

343
20:14.920 --> 20:15.720
Do it.

344
20:19.920 --> 20:21.130
Don't just say it.

345
20:33.720 --> 20:34.450
Rin,

346
20:37.360 --> 20:38.320
you're fired.

347
20:40.320 --> 20:41.320
From now on,

348
20:42.320 --> 20:44.220
don't show up to do Nine's hair.

349
20:48.210 --> 20:49.210
That can't be...

350
20:56.330 --> 20:57.720
I did nothing wrong.

351
20:59.000 --> 21:00.640
Can you stop being fucking insane like him?!

352
21:02.710 --> 21:03.600
Who the fuck are you calling insane?!

353
21:03.620 --> 21:04.480
- Huh? Who?! - Ow!

354
21:04.500 --> 21:05.440
- Who?! - Nine!

355
21:05.460 --> 21:06.560
- Nine! - Huh?!

356
21:06.730 --> 21:08.480
Spit it. Spit it out!

357
21:08.630 --> 21:10.550
Tell me what Juno is plotting against me!

358
21:10.570 --> 21:11.770
And when did you conspire with him?!

359
21:11.790 --> 21:12.840
Spit it out!!

360
21:13.020 --> 21:14.000
- Huh?! - Asshole!

361
21:14.120 --> 21:15.060
I said I didn't do it!

362
21:15.080 --> 21:16.240
Throw yourself in jail, then!

363
21:16.520 --> 21:17.520
Go on, you piece of shit!

364
21:18.630 --> 21:20.200
Nine, Nine, you need to calm down.

365
21:20.220 --> 21:21.810
We've been friends for ten years.

366
21:21.830 --> 21:22.920
What he's been saying today

367
21:23.110 --> 21:24.230
is not a lie!

368
21:24.250 --> 21:25.250
So you're backing him up?

369
21:25.270 --> 21:26.330
- Hell no! - Huh?

370
21:26.350 --> 21:27.530
- I'm not! - Nine.

371
21:27.550 --> 21:28.510
Nine, this is getting too far.

372
21:28.530 --> 21:29.430
Shut the hell up!

373
21:32.110 --> 21:33.480
Do you jerks have any damn clue...

374
21:35.020 --> 21:36.640
how fucking hard it was

375
21:36.660 --> 21:38.220
to make it here?!

376
21:39.310 --> 21:41.120
Fuck, it wasn't easy at all!!

377
21:47.130 --> 21:49.760
And I refuse to die because of you sad excuses for people!

378
21:52.850 --> 21:54.560
And if you don't want to fucking die,

379
21:56.060 --> 21:57.760
I'm giving you two damn options.

380
21:59.940 --> 22:02.200
You have to help me drag those two assholes to jail,

381
22:02.530 --> 22:04.540
- or you could... - I admit it!

382
22:08.420 --> 22:09.750
I love Juno

383
22:12.530 --> 22:14.680
the same way Sunny loves you.

384
22:17.820 --> 22:19.240
Our ties can't be severed.

385
22:26.240 --> 22:27.650
I didn't even know about it.

386
22:28.820 --> 22:30.280
I swear.

387
22:31.320 --> 22:33.360
I didn't know what he did to you!

388
22:35.530 --> 22:37.160
And the situation with that bitch Pla, too.

389
22:44.820 --> 22:45.680
Wow...

390
22:47.120 --> 22:48.220
Wow!

391
22:51.040 --> 22:52.420
So you know that bitch's name.

392
22:55.830 --> 22:58.240
She's friends with Juno. Of course I do.

393
23:01.520 --> 23:02.530
I'm sorry, Rin.

394
23:04.420 --> 23:06.410
You didn't get your answers quite right.

395
23:07.820 --> 23:08.920
Get the hell out,

396
23:09.040 --> 23:09.880
you bastard!

397
23:18.720 --> 23:19.360
Fine.

398
23:21.820 --> 23:23.520
If you want me to be the culprit so much,

399
23:25.930 --> 23:26.930
I can become one.

400
23:59.120 --> 23:59.960
Here.

401
24:00.210 --> 24:02.410
Right now, there are only Nine and Sunny upstairs.

402
24:02.430 --> 24:03.480
Go up there, sweetie.

403
24:03.920 --> 24:05.210
Thank you, Toto.

404
24:05.230 --> 24:06.360
Why did you only take one?

405
24:06.380 --> 24:07.560
That's the best I could do.

406
24:08.930 --> 24:10.280
So how did you take on Nine's gig?

407
24:10.830 --> 24:11.820
Well, someone called me in,

408
24:11.840 --> 24:13.040
so I just took it.

409
24:13.230 --> 24:15.560
I didn't think I'd be working for that bastard, though.

410
24:16.120 --> 24:17.840
Right, and what about Rin?

411
24:18.420 --> 24:19.830
He was fired,

412
24:20.040 --> 24:21.200
fresh out of the job.

413
24:21.220 --> 24:22.710
That's not all of it.

414
24:22.730 --> 24:24.680
He told Rin to bow at his feet

415
24:24.700 --> 24:26.440
and even grabbed Rin by his hair.

416
24:27.130 --> 24:28.130
It was intense.

417
24:28.160 --> 24:29.080
Holy shit!

418
24:29.130 --> 24:30.790
This is getting too far.

419
24:30.810 --> 24:31.620
Tell me about it.

420
24:31.640 --> 24:32.230
Told you,

421
24:32.250 --> 24:34.440
if you turned this whole thing into a series, it'd blow up for sure.

422
24:34.460 --> 24:35.720
I'll help with the script.

423
24:36.020 --> 24:36.770
I should be the one...

424
24:36.790 --> 24:38.520
who takes responsibility.

425
24:40.420 --> 24:42.440
You know why I'm coming forward with the truth, Wan?

426
24:49.330 --> 24:51.830
Because we created that monster.

427
24:56.620 --> 24:57.960
Are you sure you want to do this?

428
24:59.500 --> 25:00.800
I am, Cher.

429
25:02.220 --> 25:03.120
Wan, I don't think it's a good idea.

430
25:03.140 --> 25:04.320
Don't go up there.

431
25:04.340 --> 25:06.400
It's already gotten physical.

432
25:06.710 --> 25:07.830
And you're going in there alone

433
25:07.850 --> 25:09.130
without me.

434
25:09.330 --> 25:11.240
No, I have to do this.

435
25:13.120 --> 25:14.200
Can you go with him, then?

436
25:15.220 --> 25:16.020
Mm.

437
25:16.440 --> 25:18.080
I can do this on my own, Cher.

438
25:18.500 --> 25:19.960
Don't worry about me.

439
25:20.100 --> 25:21.400
I'll leave as soon as possible.

440
25:23.210 --> 25:24.830
That way, you won't get in trouble.

441
25:30.520 --> 25:31.520
Hey, Wan!

442
25:34.920 --> 25:36.120
In case you run into a journalist.

443
25:37.620 --> 25:38.520
Alright.

444
25:42.710 --> 25:44.480
It was such a fucking blast upstairs.

445
25:44.720 --> 25:45.930
It was wild, girl.

446
25:45.950 --> 25:46.880
Why didn't you record it in secret?

447
25:46.900 --> 25:49.040
I loved it when Rin shed tears.

448
25:49.310 --> 25:50.680
I've been dying to see that for ages.

449
25:51.630 --> 25:52.690
Was it your dream?

450
25:52.710 --> 25:53.640
Heck yeah.

451
25:54.710 --> 25:56.200
But I had to like, act cute...

452
25:56.330 --> 25:57.720
- Play it cool. - And what did you do?

453
25:58.030 --> 25:59.940
I just stood there completely still.

454
25:59.960 --> 26:00.760
You were like...

455
26:01.820 --> 26:03.120
- This? - Like...

456
26:03.510 --> 26:04.500
A cute little smirk.

457
26:04.530 --> 26:05.520
But inside, you were like...

458
26:05.850 --> 26:06.760
- "Huh!" - Heck yeah.

459
26:15.230 --> 26:16.830
Nine found out that Rin

460
26:17.210 --> 26:19.080
had a meal with Pla and me,

461
26:20.430 --> 26:21.760
so he fired him.

462
26:28.830 --> 26:30.230
Don't feel guilty.

463
26:30.530 --> 26:32.840
Right now, we have to become even angrier at Nine.

464
26:33.900 --> 26:35.280
Given how it turned out,

465
26:36.400 --> 26:37.640
all we can do is keep going.

466
26:38.130 --> 26:40.840
I don't think he's doing as Wan says.

467
26:41.710 --> 26:42.500
Exactly.

468
26:42.520 --> 26:44.430
Let's not wait. This has to be done ASAP.

469
26:44.450 --> 26:45.320
No,

470
26:46.320 --> 26:47.940
we already promised Wan.

471
26:48.320 --> 26:49.180
We have to wait.

472
27:19.010 --> 27:19.910
Why are you here?

473
27:19.930 --> 27:20.620
Mama,

474
27:22.630 --> 27:23.680
I'll handle it.

475
27:24.730 --> 27:25.930
- Nine, but he... - Mama!

476
27:25.950 --> 27:27.530
Let me handle it. Just leave for now.

477
27:46.120 --> 27:47.840
I heard you went back home to make noodle soup.

478
27:48.120 --> 27:49.020
How did it go?

479
27:49.230 --> 27:50.400
Were you happy?

480
27:53.030 --> 27:54.030
Pretty good.

481
27:56.830 --> 27:57.710
Good to hear.

482
27:59.090 --> 28:00.960
Some professions are just not meant for us, huh?

483
28:03.220 --> 28:04.840
Why did you fire Rin?

484
28:08.770 --> 28:11.300
Woo! Look at how fast word travels.

485
28:12.210 --> 28:13.210
It's nothing.

486
28:14.030 --> 28:15.160
There were just some problems.

487
28:17.430 --> 28:20.400
Guess I have to give them rat poison to kill the whole nest next time.

488
28:21.520 --> 28:23.600
Like how you paid someone to leak the video at the MD event,

489
28:23.620 --> 28:24.400
the guy named Co?

490
28:35.420 --> 28:37.920
You're not here to congratulate me, are you?

491
28:39.910 --> 28:41.060
I'm here to ask you to tell the truth

492
28:41.080 --> 28:43.000
about how I didn't shove you into the pool.

493
28:43.510 --> 28:45.310
Right...

494
28:47.140 --> 28:48.530
So that's what it actually is?

495
28:49.930 --> 28:51.160
It's not Rin,

496
28:51.530 --> 28:53.130
Juno,

497
28:54.040 --> 28:55.630
or that fucking sasaeng.

498
28:56.720 --> 28:58.920
You're the one who's behind all this, huh?

499
28:59.830 --> 29:00.630
Aren't you?!

500
29:00.920 --> 29:01.640
Huh?!

501
29:03.930 --> 29:04.930
Nine,

502
29:05.910 --> 29:08.440
I'm here to warn you before it all goes down.

503
29:08.930 --> 29:10.420
Someone really has proof on hand.

504
29:10.440 --> 29:11.170
What proof?

505
29:11.190 --> 29:12.140
Everything!

506
29:13.420 --> 29:15.080
Both the evidence and the witness.

507
29:15.220 --> 29:17.310
What you've done to people

508
29:17.330 --> 29:19.390
will be revealed after this press conference.

509
29:19.420 --> 29:20.730
Are you threatening me? Huh?

510
29:20.750 --> 29:21.640
I'm not.

511
29:22.010 --> 29:23.720
This is not a threat, but a warning.

512
29:27.010 --> 29:27.920
You know?

513
29:29.500 --> 29:30.600
You were terrible

514
29:31.320 --> 29:32.730
on your first day,

515
29:33.520 --> 29:35.330
now your acting is still the same fucking flop.

516
29:35.660 --> 29:36.530
Do you realize that?

517
29:36.550 --> 29:37.480
I'm being honest.

518
29:43.020 --> 29:43.860
What the hell?!

519
29:43.880 --> 29:45.000
Give me your phone!

520
29:45.420 --> 29:46.660
Give me your damn phone!

521
29:47.480 --> 29:48.760
You're recording it, right?

522
29:49.310 --> 29:50.520
You're recording it, right?!

523
30:23.130 --> 30:24.810
How could you even stand yourself?

524
30:24.830 --> 30:26.620
Have you ever looked at yourself in the mirror?

525
30:27.620 --> 30:30.160
You're not the person whose photos I took every day anymore.

526
30:30.570 --> 30:32.200
I don't even know who the fuck you are.

527
30:40.220 --> 30:41.400
So, you want me to...

528
30:42.900 --> 30:44.720
confess about the video at the MD event?

529
30:45.410 --> 30:47.210
Then you're gonna abandon your noodle shop

530
30:47.230 --> 30:49.020
and glide back beautifully into the industry

531
30:49.820 --> 30:50.920
while my fucking life

532
30:51.260 --> 30:52.210
falls apart completely?!

533
30:52.230 --> 30:53.150
No!

534
30:53.170 --> 30:54.240
I don't believe you.

535
30:57.340 --> 30:59.900
The reason I staged myself falling into the pool

536
30:59.920 --> 31:01.120
was because of you.

537
31:01.320 --> 31:03.150
And the reason I'm struggling

538
31:03.170 --> 31:04.040
to get rid of you

539
31:04.060 --> 31:06.000
is that you were taking everything from me!

540
31:06.020 --> 31:06.970
Do you dare say

541
31:06.990 --> 31:07.880
that it wasn't true?!

542
31:07.900 --> 31:08.840
It was true!

543
31:11.540 --> 31:12.680
Not everything was, though.

544
31:13.040 --> 31:14.560
Back then, I lied to you

545
31:14.580 --> 31:16.030
that I wasn't into Third

546
31:16.410 --> 31:18.200
when I actually had feelings for your partner.

547
31:18.430 --> 31:19.640
You got that one right.

548
31:26.770 --> 31:27.840
Fucking knew it...

549
31:32.900 --> 31:34.380
It's too late to confess now, right?

550
31:35.930 --> 31:36.910
I know,

551
31:38.230 --> 31:39.680
but it's not too late for you.

552
31:40.420 --> 31:41.590
I'm begging you

553
31:41.610 --> 31:43.680
to please end this yourself.

554
31:43.800 --> 31:45.610
Don't let other people do it.

555
31:58.700 --> 31:59.500
Play it.

556
32:00.320 --> 32:01.120
Hm?

557
32:01.820 --> 32:02.540
Do it.

558
32:03.410 --> 32:04.360
Nine!

559
32:07.330 --> 32:09.080
You jerks just don't have the video.

560
32:09.930 --> 32:10.860
If you did,

561
32:10.880 --> 32:12.560
you would've revealed it a long time ago!

562
32:14.630 --> 32:16.520
You just want the satisfaction

563
32:17.530 --> 32:19.760
of seeing me destroying myself in the middle of my own event,

564
32:20.580 --> 32:21.420
isn't that right?!

565
32:21.440 --> 32:22.520
Huh? Isn't it?

566
32:22.720 --> 32:23.530
Isn't it?!

567
32:23.840 --> 32:24.420
Huh?!

568
32:24.440 --> 32:26.090
Isn't that right? Isn't it?!

569
32:26.110 --> 32:27.230
I'm right, aren't I?!

570
32:27.250 --> 32:27.960
Aren't I?!

571
32:27.980 --> 32:29.210
I'm right, aren't I?!

572
32:32.760 --> 32:33.520
Nine,

573
32:36.220 --> 32:37.480
time to be on standby.

574
32:42.140 --> 32:44.680
You have until the end of the press conference.

575
32:46.590 --> 32:49.430
After that, I'll consider my job done.

576
32:51.330 --> 32:52.510
What fucking job?

577
32:57.740 --> 32:59.020
Your fanboy.

578
33:04.730 --> 33:06.430
♫I'm just a fanboy♫

579
33:10.020 --> 33:10.920
Nine...

580
33:40.920 --> 33:42.930
You have until the end of the press conference.

581
33:43.940 --> 33:45.520
If you want me to be the culprit so much...

582
33:45.810 --> 33:46.830
I'll do whatever it takes.

583
33:46.850 --> 33:49.420
After that, I'll consider my job done.

584
33:49.440 --> 33:51.840
I'm not keeping your asses around!

585
33:51.880 --> 33:53.280
So, what do you say?

586
33:53.860 --> 33:55.120
What do you think? You've been quiet.

587
33:55.330 --> 33:55.930
Right.

588
33:55.960 --> 33:57.920
I just told everyone

589
33:58.610 --> 34:00.040
about how I believed that everyone

590
34:00.060 --> 34:01.680
saw your potential

591
34:01.890 --> 34:03.370
like I always have,

592
34:12.540 --> 34:14.219
and that I thought it was time

593
34:14.610 --> 34:16.900
for you to tell everyone

594
34:16.920 --> 34:18.080
about your mega project.

595
34:18.500 --> 34:19.500
Right...

596
34:22.500 --> 34:24.000
Alright, so...

597
34:25.020 --> 34:26.150
As you may have

598
34:26.170 --> 34:28.440
already seen on the news...

599
34:29.320 --> 34:32.480
I would like to personally announce that

600
34:32.800 --> 34:34.190
I have been...

601
34:35.000 --> 34:36.219
cast in a series...

602
34:36.520 --> 34:37.400
called...

603
34:38.050 --> 34:40.360
'IDYLLIC LIES' for its third season.

604
34:45.350 --> 34:46.520
But this time, I heard that

605
34:46.540 --> 34:48.080
my bias is playing the lead role!

606
34:48.100 --> 34:49.239
Wanna try auditioning for this? [Casting Call]

607
34:49.310 --> 34:50.199
You get paid

608
34:50.380 --> 34:51.600
and get to act with Nine.

609
34:51.820 --> 34:53.420
Wan, right?

610
34:53.810 --> 34:54.480
Yes.

611
34:54.510 --> 34:56.000
[Wan]

612
34:57.770 --> 34:59.520
And the role I'm taking on...

613
34:59.540 --> 35:01.120
is "Da Long"

614
35:01.410 --> 35:02.420
who is...

615
35:02.440 --> 35:04.640
also the lead in this season.

616
35:06.200 --> 35:09.740
This is my first time going international.

617
35:09.760 --> 35:11.440
I'd like to express just how thrilled I am.

618
35:11.610 --> 35:13.840
Let me rave about Nine to you guys.

619
35:13.860 --> 35:16.680
The series' production team reached out to Nine themselves

620
35:16.840 --> 35:18.400
because they liked him so much.

621
35:18.710 --> 35:20.040
Apart from acting,

622
35:20.200 --> 35:21.520
he can sing and dance,

623
35:21.670 --> 35:22.960
and he's an all-around Rising Star.

624
35:23.110 --> 35:23.900
He's the best!

625
35:23.920 --> 35:24.550
He's cute,

626
35:24.570 --> 35:26.220
pretty, handsome, majestic, and charming.

627
35:26.240 --> 35:26.970
He's a freaking genius

628
35:26.990 --> 35:28.880
and a complete all-rounder.

629
35:29.140 --> 35:31.080
Seeing the script for the first time...

630
35:31.290 --> 35:32.710
Wow, it was incredibly tough.

631
35:33.110 --> 35:34.630
Even I facepalmed after I saw it.

632
35:34.650 --> 35:35.420
Right?

633
35:36.610 --> 35:37.760
Anyway...

634
35:38.370 --> 35:39.520
give the fans...

635
35:39.920 --> 35:41.150
a bit of a spoiler.

636
35:41.170 --> 35:42.760
I already asked the team's permission

637
35:42.950 --> 35:44.640
for you to give them a little spoiler.

638
35:44.800 --> 35:45.600
Oh.

639
35:45.800 --> 35:46.630
Okay. Sure thing.

640
35:46.650 --> 35:47.200
Well...

641
35:47.950 --> 35:49.210
when it comes to Da Long,

642
35:49.230 --> 35:50.340
I feel rather bad

643
35:50.360 --> 35:52.320
for the character.

644
35:52.630 --> 35:53.630
Uh...

645
35:54.270 --> 35:55.720
The audition script was very short,

646
35:56.480 --> 35:58.740
yet I could feel...

647
35:59.520 --> 36:02.160
how sorrowful his life is at all times.

648
36:02.670 --> 36:04.620
How could you even fucking stand yourself?

649
36:05.260 --> 36:07.120
Have you ever looked at yourself in the mirror?

650
36:11.420 --> 36:12.820
He is someone...

651
36:13.960 --> 36:15.800
who has everything he ever wanted.

652
36:23.330 --> 36:24.360
Yet...

653
36:24.660 --> 36:26.030
it feels like he has nothing.

654
36:30.610 --> 36:32.480
No matter how much he receives...

655
36:33.230 --> 36:34.230
he's never fulfilled.

656
36:36.260 --> 36:38.360
I can't help but think about...

657
36:39.500 --> 36:41.520
where this character's path...

658
36:41.800 --> 36:43.300
will end?

659
36:44.930 --> 36:45.960
Right here.

660
36:47.470 --> 36:48.520
What a blast.

661
36:49.200 --> 36:50.760
My book's for sure flying off the shelves.

662
36:59.640 --> 37:00.640
Please stay tuned.

663
37:01.670 --> 37:02.870
Alright, I'd like you guys

664
37:02.890 --> 37:04.860
to keep an eye out for this series.

665
37:04.880 --> 37:06.620
And thank you very much,

666
37:06.640 --> 37:08.830
all crew members.

667
37:08.850 --> 37:10.800
Also, thank you, everyone,

668
37:10.820 --> 37:12.060
for, uh...

669
37:12.080 --> 37:14.080
always supporting me all this time.

670
37:14.610 --> 37:16.840
Without you guys, I wouldn't...

671
37:16.860 --> 37:20.180
have been here like I am now.

672
37:21.010 --> 37:21.960
Thank you.

673
37:24.320 --> 37:24.760
Come on!

674
37:24.780 --> 37:26.200
Anything you wanna say to your fans?

675
37:26.400 --> 37:29.520
Look, around ten thousand people are watching this live!

676
37:41.360 --> 37:43.560
I'm so happy that I get to work with you, Nine.

677
37:43.720 --> 37:45.120
I'm your fan.

678
37:59.830 --> 38:00.840
Is he gonna say it?

679
38:01.300 --> 38:02.040
He's not.

680
38:02.480 --> 38:04.600
Boys, can you please shut the hell up?

681
38:21.290 --> 38:23.160
You just want the satisfaction

682
38:23.320 --> 38:25.560
