687
38:31.820 --> 38:33.600
You're a lot more adorable than me.

688
38:33.680 --> 38:34.760
Betray me.

689
38:34.830 --> 38:36.360
I like you just the same, Nine.

690
38:36.820 --> 38:38.000
Or hurt me.

691
38:38.050 --> 38:39.240
Are you okay?

692
38:41.360 --> 38:42.510
I'll do everything I can

693
38:42.530 --> 38:44.220
to help you succeed, Nine,

694
38:44.630 --> 38:46.640
because I'm your fanboy.

695
38:54.330 --> 38:55.820
Actually, I'm probably not...

696
38:58.420 --> 39:01.440
the best or the sweetest person out there.

697
39:10.240 --> 39:12.110
In my life, I have...

698
39:12.430 --> 39:15.680
made so many mistakes.

699
39:18.520 --> 39:20.030
Still, I've always received opportunities

700
39:20.050 --> 39:22.120
and have been loved by everyone.

701
39:27.800 --> 39:30.080
Well, sometimes, I wonder...

702
39:31.630 --> 39:33.220
if I still...

703
39:34.100 --> 39:36.400
deserve all this,

704
39:40.410 --> 39:42.600
so today, I...

705
39:54.020 --> 39:55.720
would like to apologize to everyone...

706
39:58.340 --> 39:59.720
that I've disappointed.

707
40:01.500 --> 40:02.720
Is this who you truly are?

708
40:07.120 --> 40:07.820
Yeah,

709
40:08.480 --> 40:09.520
this is who I am.

710
40:12.330 --> 40:14.720
And I'd like to apologize to everyone that I have...

711
40:16.820 --> 40:17.820
hurt.

712
40:19.810 --> 40:21.100
Thanks for saving me,

713
40:21.120 --> 40:21.710
and...

714
40:21.730 --> 40:23.400
I'm sorry I almost drowned you.

715
40:24.610 --> 40:25.680
It's alright, Nine.

716
41:02.520 --> 41:03.150
I'm sorry.

717
41:03.170 --> 41:05.960
I shouldn't have made this so emotional, so...

718
41:07.260 --> 41:08.420
Uh...

719
41:09.820 --> 41:10.840
I am...

720
41:10.970 --> 41:12.550
over the moon today

721
41:12.570 --> 41:14.290
that I'm able to stand here

722
41:14.310 --> 41:16.510
and tell everyone this good news.

723
41:16.720 --> 41:18.800
This is such a good day for me.

724
41:19.220 --> 41:20.220
Yeah, so...

725
41:20.420 --> 41:22.120
I'd like to thank everyone

726
41:22.140 --> 41:23.710
for joining us today.

727
41:23.730 --> 41:25.120
Thank you so, so much.

728
41:32.750 --> 41:34.020
Right, okay.

729
41:34.040 --> 41:35.720
Now, how about we take some photos

730
41:35.740 --> 41:37.400
to remember it by?

731
41:37.420 --> 41:38.350
Of course. Sure thing.

732
41:38.370 --> 41:39.880
Okay, photographers, please.

733
41:57.400 --> 41:58.810
From now on...

734
41:59.820 --> 42:01.380
It's showtime.

735
42:04.540 --> 42:05.520
Hello,

736
42:05.620 --> 42:06.740
start the live-stream.

737
42:21.440 --> 42:24.640
[You've done your best]

738
42:39.710 --> 42:40.640
Ready?

739
42:42.860 --> 42:44.020
We're going live in

740
42:45.390 --> 42:46.040
three...

741
42:46.520 --> 42:47.340
two...

742
42:47.870 --> 42:48.800
one. [Start Streaming]

743
42:53.210 --> 42:53.920
Uh...

744
42:54.200 --> 42:55.500
Pitch, a moment.

745
42:57.210 --> 43:00.240
So, I think we should release...

746
43:00.420 --> 43:02.070
a solo piece first, no?

747
43:02.090 --> 43:02.990
It's just that I don't want

748
43:03.010 --> 43:04.980
the fans to wait while we're filming.

749
43:05.760 --> 43:08.010
But we've never discussed this before, Nine.

750
43:10.440 --> 43:11.080
Right.

751
43:14.620 --> 43:15.310
Uh...

752
43:17.410 --> 43:18.310
Everyone,

753
43:18.330 --> 43:21.760
I have a secret yet to be told.

754
43:23.110 --> 43:23.930
That secret,

755
43:23.950 --> 43:26.720
is it the same one Third's going live about?

756
43:30.790 --> 43:31.880
Put it on.

757
43:41.660 --> 43:42.510
Hello.

758
43:43.080 --> 43:44.620
Today, I intend to go live

759
43:44.640 --> 43:47.280
because there's a truth that needs to be brought to light.

760
43:48.330 --> 43:50.120
What we're about to discuss

761
43:50.140 --> 43:52.000
concerns "Nine Nopphanat."

762
43:52.830 --> 43:54.620
I've been working with Nine for a long time,

763
43:55.010 --> 43:56.640
and we've known each other since high school.

764
43:58.010 --> 43:59.680
We used to be coworkers

765
44:03.730 --> 44:04.840
and best friends.

766
44:06.220 --> 44:07.800
We were once good friends.

767
44:09.110 --> 44:10.160
I admit

768
44:11.310 --> 44:12.920
that I have wronged him

769
44:14.160 --> 44:15.850
and hurt his feelings,

770
44:17.110 --> 44:20.560
but that has nothing to do with his vile actions towards other people.

771
44:25.840 --> 44:28.430
The person who took the hardest hit in this matter

772
44:28.820 --> 44:30.200
is "Wan Ashawin."

773
44:32.570 --> 44:33.410
Whoa...

774
44:33.430 --> 44:35.960
The video that led to Wan being accused of pushing Nine into the pool,

775
44:36.310 --> 44:38.400
subjecting him to public criticism

776
44:39.010 --> 44:40.710
to the point that 'The Deep Between Us'

777
44:40.730 --> 44:41.920
had to be canceled,

778
44:42.900 --> 44:44.430
allow me to make it clear,

779
44:46.810 --> 44:48.320
is not true.

780
44:48.920 --> 44:50.760
Today, I have a video as proof

781
44:50.870 --> 44:53.120
which is not a fragment of the incident

782
44:54.190 --> 44:56.680
but the whole truth.

783
44:57.610 --> 45:00.600
I'd like to confirm that this video was neither edited nor AI-generated.

784
45:05.100 --> 45:06.590
Nine, we're not doing this!

785
45:08.820 --> 45:09.820
But how?

786
45:10.230 --> 45:11.230
You mean, this?

787
45:15.570 --> 45:16.250
What?

788
45:16.280 --> 45:17.520
Has the table turned?

789
45:18.210 --> 45:19.910
As you've witnessed with your own eyes,

790
45:20.160 --> 45:22.210
Wan did not shove Nine into the pool.

791
45:22.860 --> 45:25.760
It was Nine who let himself fall to stage the incident.

792
45:26.930 --> 45:29.520
And as for the video that was played at the MD event...

793
45:29.700 --> 45:31.880
Your boy shoved mine into the pool!

794
45:32.290 --> 45:34.200
That was what happened

795
45:34.460 --> 45:35.800
after Nine already fell into the water.

796
45:36.900 --> 45:39.800
No one knew how this video was played at the MD event,

797
45:41.030 --> 45:42.480
but we do now.

798
45:49.610 --> 45:50.480
I...

799
45:51.890 --> 45:53.600
was paid by Nine Nopphanat

800
45:54.170 --> 45:56.100
to disguise myself as a staff member

801
45:56.120 --> 45:57.600
and play the video during the event.

802
45:58.490 --> 46:00.520
I really didn't mean to hurt anyone.

803
46:01.510 --> 46:03.120
I just did what I was paid to do.

804
46:03.940 --> 46:05.400
I'm truly sorry, everyone.

805
46:09.410 --> 46:10.730
Every incident

806
46:10.750 --> 46:12.920
has been staged by Nine Nopphanat.

807
46:34.820 --> 46:36.430
I have additional proof.

808
46:45.020 --> 46:46.680
Third has a video of me falling into the pool.

809
46:47.350 --> 46:48.010
Huh?

810
46:48.740 --> 46:49.620
How could he have it?

811
46:49.640 --> 46:50.960
Renji recorded it.

812
46:52.010 --> 46:53.400
Then tell me the truth.

813
46:55.070 --> 46:56.810
We got into a fight, and he dared me to do it.

814
46:56.830 --> 46:58.560
I just let myself fall, and that was it.

815
46:58.910 --> 47:00.590
Haven't I told you to get a grip?!

816
47:00.610 --> 47:02.640
You always act like a stupid villain in a soap opera.

817
47:03.210 --> 47:05.360
But I never said I was shoved, did I?

818
47:05.710 --> 47:07.000
You said it.

819
47:10.810 --> 47:11.700
All done?

820
47:11.720 --> 47:13.720
I'll touch up your face so you can hurry back to work.

821
47:16.120 --> 47:17.100
That's it.

822
47:17.640 --> 47:18.900
Yes, that's right.

823
47:25.780 --> 47:28.010
Do you know why I'm involved in this?

824
47:30.920 --> 47:32.230
Because, actually,

825
47:33.630 --> 47:35.520
it happened to me before.

826
47:37.310 --> 47:39.220
You probably still remember

827
47:40.310 --> 47:41.990
when Thee...

828
47:42.200 --> 47:43.510
my partner,

829
47:45.020 --> 47:47.000
passed away in a car accident.

830
47:50.610 --> 47:53.210
Meanwhile, an audio clip was leaked,

831
47:55.210 --> 47:56.820
in which I...

832
47:58.990 --> 48:00.600
told Thee to go away and die.

833
48:04.910 --> 48:07.090
This audio clip was edited down to just the final part

834
48:08.420 --> 48:10.560
when I was furious with Thee.

835
48:12.530 --> 48:14.020
Yes, I admit

836
48:14.040 --> 48:16.120
that I used harsh language,

837
48:17.670 --> 48:20.440
and I still feel guilty to this day.

838
48:23.360 --> 48:24.720
But if anyone

839
48:24.740 --> 48:26.980
was there that day,

840
48:28.020 --> 48:30.520
like someone who recorded this audio clip in secret,

841
48:31.310 --> 48:33.480
you would realize why I said it.

842
48:52.610 --> 48:54.110
Juno, just let me explain.

843
48:55.680 --> 48:57.090
What else is there to explain?

844
48:57.270 --> 48:57.920
Huh?

845
48:59.230 --> 49:00.480
I've talked to you...

846
49:01.870 --> 49:02.920
I cared about you,

847
49:03.250 --> 49:05.200
but you would never listen.

848
49:06.110 --> 49:07.730
But I really need to use it

849
49:08.320 --> 49:10.120
because I have to work, Juno.

850
49:10.810 --> 49:12.360
But it's drugs!

851
49:15.930 --> 49:18.040
You were wrong from the moment you decided to use.

852
49:19.600 --> 49:21.090
I told you, didn't I?

853
49:21.610 --> 49:23.610
If you decided to use the first time,

854
49:23.630 --> 49:25.080
- you'd always need to use... - I know.

855
49:25.630 --> 49:26.630
I know...

856
49:27.820 --> 49:29.560
I really do. I know about it all.

857
49:31.110 --> 49:32.110
But this time

858
49:33.500 --> 49:35.320
will genuinely be the last time I use.

859
49:35.500 --> 49:36.360
I promise.

860
49:48.360 --> 49:50.160
Open your eyes wide.

861
49:51.000 --> 49:52.160
In this state,

862
49:53.330 --> 49:55.000
can you even work? Huh?

863
49:56.960 --> 49:58.190
Forget work,

864
49:59.020 --> 50:01.800
you don't even look human at this point.

865
50:02.030 --> 50:02.720
Juno...

866
50:03.230 --> 50:04.720
What the hell is your problem?

867
50:05.150 --> 50:07.110
I'm not killing anyone.

868
50:07.400 --> 50:08.090
Huh?

869
50:08.520 --> 50:09.200
And this...

870
50:09.330 --> 50:10.590
This is my body

871
50:11.940 --> 50:13.040
and my life.

872
50:14.250 --> 50:15.890
I can do whatever I want, right?

873
50:25.610 --> 50:26.610
I'm sorry.

874
50:27.800 --> 50:28.800
I'm sorry...

875
50:32.310 --> 50:33.220
I'm sorry...

876
50:36.850 --> 50:38.080
So you're choosing it?

877
50:41.420 --> 50:42.320
Juno...

878
50:44.920 --> 50:45.920
Seriously,

879
50:47.680 --> 50:49.320
don't make a big deal out of this.

880
50:50.520 --> 50:51.590
It has nothing to do with what we have.

881
50:51.610 --> 50:53.200
It sure does, huh?

882
50:54.080 --> 50:55.300
Did you even use your fucking brain?

883
50:55.330 --> 50:56.500
Did you even use it?

884
50:56.530 --> 50:58.760
I am your fucking partner.

885
50:59.350 --> 51:02.920
If I see how fucked up you look in the scenes,

886
51:03.250 --> 51:04.780
do you think I can fucking act?

887
51:04.810 --> 51:06.100
Have you ever thought about that?

888
51:06.130 --> 51:07.440
You're fucking selfish.

889
51:07.620 --> 51:08.670
Selfish...

890
51:11.040 --> 51:12.280
I'm selfish?

891
51:13.900 --> 51:14.870
So, simply put...

892
51:14.890 --> 51:16.760
you're worried that you wouldn't be able to act.

893
51:17.610 --> 51:18.600
You're no fucking different.

894
51:19.520 --> 51:20.930
How could you fucking say that?

895
51:22.040 --> 51:23.310
How could you fucking say that?

896
51:23.470 --> 51:24.560
Well, you're fucking selfish.

897
51:25.750 --> 51:28.000
My older brother went to prison because of drugs.

898
51:28.540 --> 51:30.010
And my family...

899
51:30.030 --> 51:31.700
became broken because of drugs.

900
51:31.720 --> 51:32.880
You know it damn well, don't you?

901
51:32.900 --> 51:35.180
So how could you spew that shit out?

902
51:35.200 --> 51:35.960
Bastard...

903
51:44.150 --> 51:45.240
Damn it!

904
51:59.490 --> 52:01.160
Thee was so stressed out because of work,

905
52:02.930 --> 52:04.210
so much so that...

906
52:05.480 --> 52:07.010
he had to rely on some kind of help

907
52:07.540 --> 52:09.600
so that he could keep on working.

908
52:12.040 --> 52:14.120
I believe you all know what I mean.

909
52:25.730 --> 52:26.730
I'm the fucking worst.

910
52:31.450 --> 52:32.610
I'm a piece of shit.

911
52:38.030 --> 52:39.810
I don't deserve to be here with you, Juno.

912
52:44.680 --> 52:45.760
Everything I do...

913
52:46.480 --> 52:47.400
is fucking wrong.

914
52:49.180 --> 52:50.560
That's the best you could come up with?

915
52:58.920 --> 53:00.200
I don't know what else to do.

916
53:01.010 --> 53:01.920
Can you tell me, then, Juno?

917
53:02.230 --> 53:03.100
What do you want me to do?

918
53:03.120 --> 53:04.120
Tell me, Juno.

919
53:05.450 --> 53:07.000
Just fucking die, then.

920
53:07.720 --> 53:09.040
If that's all you could come up with

921
53:09.060 --> 53:10.690
from that little brain you have left,

922
53:10.810 --> 53:13.300
go rot in hell wherever you want.

923
53:13.730 --> 53:14.800
I don't fucking care.

924
53:17.890 --> 53:19.030
All this time,

925
53:20.330 --> 53:22.280
I never came forward with this matter

926
53:24.810 --> 53:26.490
until the public condemned me

927
53:27.640 --> 53:29.760
for Thee's death,

928
53:31.740 --> 53:33.280
to the point that I had to leave the industry.

929
53:35.500 --> 53:36.620
Do whatever the fuck you want.

930
53:36.640 --> 53:37.480
Be my guest.

931
53:45.920 --> 53:49.160
All this was because I didn't want to tarnish Thee's image.

932
53:58.840 --> 54:00.810
I wanted everyone who loved him,

933
54:02.160 --> 54:03.480
whether it was his family,

934
54:04.140 --> 54:05.240
friends,

935
54:06.060 --> 54:07.640
or his fans

936
54:08.600 --> 54:10.600
to cherish his memories the way they were.

937
54:17.260 --> 54:18.360
I thought that...

938
54:19.800 --> 54:21.480
it was the last thing

939
54:22.330 --> 54:25.080
I could do for someone I loved.

940
54:38.200 --> 54:39.800
But by choosing to stay silent,

941
54:42.200 --> 54:43.640
I ended up

942
54:43.660 --> 54:46.200
letting someone who intentionally harmed me

943
54:47.290 --> 54:48.860
get away with it to this day,

944
54:51.840 --> 54:53.680
the same person who used the same way

945
54:54.120 --> 54:56.160
to put everyone here through the same thing.

946
55:14.200 --> 55:15.360
And that person

947
55:16.690 --> 55:17.920
is "Nine Nopphanat."

948
55:27.550 --> 55:28.680
It was true, wasn't it?

949
55:31.620 --> 55:32.860
I would like everyone to share

950
55:32.880 --> 55:35.680
this statement as much as possible.

951
55:35.820 --> 55:36.820
Can you do something?

952
55:36.840 --> 55:37.710
Turn it all off.

953
55:37.730 --> 55:38.320
Do whatever you can.

954
55:38.460 --> 55:39.400
Can you shut it down?!

955
55:40.720 --> 55:42.110
- Close it already. - Nine, Nine.

956
55:42.190 --> 55:43.370
Nine, please answer my question.

957
55:43.400 --> 55:44.360
That's way too far.

958
55:44.390 --> 55:45.640
Is there any humanity left in you?

959
55:45.700 --> 55:46.410
Nine!

960
55:49.560 --> 55:50.940
- Anything else you'd like to say? - Don't record!

961
55:50.960 --> 55:51.690
Don't!

962
55:51.710 --> 55:52.910
Stop asking!

963
55:53.050 --> 55:53.760
No more questions!

964
55:53.780 --> 55:54.560
No recording!

965
55:54.760 --> 55:55.810
Nine Nopphanat,

966
55:56.260 --> 55:59.430
the person who's holding a press conference regarding his future,

967
56:00.130 --> 56:01.330
will finally realize

968
56:02.190 --> 56:04.560
how many heads and lives he has used as stepping stones

969
56:04.920 --> 56:08.800
just so he could climb up to where he is.

970
56:08.910 --> 56:10.320
- Nine? - Nine, what's going on?

971
56:10.350 --> 56:11.910
Please answer my question.

972
56:12.320 --> 56:14.200
What was the reason you did it, Nine?

973
56:14.230 --> 56:15.280
Nine, please answer the question.

974
56:15.300 --> 56:16.520
Please answer the question.

975
56:18.160 --> 56:19.850
Everything that happened was real, wasn't it?

976
56:19.880 --> 56:20.560
Nine?

977
56:22.370 --> 56:23.490
Shut it down.

978
56:23.510 --> 56:24.520
Nine?

979
56:26.120 --> 56:27.050
That's right. Leave!

980
56:27.070 --> 56:28.200
Everything that happened was real, wasn't it?

981
56:28.220 --> 56:29.240
You've gone this far.

982
56:29.260 --> 56:30.510
Is there even a bit of humanity left in you?!

983
56:30.530 --> 56:31.210
Nine?

984
56:31.230 --> 56:32.580
Yeah, that's the end of him.

985
56:32.720 --> 56:33.820
Gone. There's no coming back from that.

986
56:33.840 --> 56:35.190
Nine, you slandered Wan, didn't you?

987
56:35.210 --> 56:36.720
Ugh, do it... Shut it down now.

988
56:36.830 --> 56:38.040
Around ten thousand people are watching!

989
56:38.220 --> 56:40.800
Are we really gonna keep supporting this kind of person?

990
56:41.220 --> 56:44.310
If someone like Nine got away scot-free in the industry,

991
56:44.550 --> 56:46.040
our showbiz...

992
56:49.010 --> 56:51.310
would only go further down the damn hill.

993
56:51.710 --> 56:52.710
I'm sure of it.

994
57:02.260 --> 57:04.720
This world doesn't need a piece of shit like you, Nine.

995
57:04.740 --> 57:07.610
How could you do that to my baby? Making his life a living hell?!

996
57:09.000 --> 57:12.240
Nine, bastard, know that if you die, the world will thrive in virtue.

997
57:12.520 --> 57:14.000
Are you still human?

998
57:14.020 --> 57:16.590
You thirst for fame so much that you had to go that far?

999
57:16.890 --> 57:18.150
VE ENT, where the hell are you?

1000
57:18.180 --> 57:19.210
Still doing nothing.

1001
57:19.240 --> 57:20.300
Gotta give it up

1002
57:20.320 --> 57:22.090
for the most fucking mismanaged company.

1003
57:22.110 --> 57:24.280
Can't believe how he used the hands of the dead to hurt other people.

1004
57:24.300 --> 57:26.280
Broke your back for his protection. Turns out he's a real POS.

1005
57:26.300 --> 57:27.880
Embarrassed on behalf of his fans.

1006
57:28.110 --> 57:29.540
Understood Third completely now.

1007
57:29.560 --> 57:30.220
I knew he'd be like this.

1008
57:30.240 --> 57:31.200
Unfollowed him on every platform.

1009
57:31.220 --> 57:31.920
His look's the only good thing about him.

1010
57:31.950 --> 57:32.890
- I wanna throw up. - Has anyone apologized to Wan?

1011
57:32.910 --> 57:34.480
- How was I ever a fan of him? - I'm out, no more of this.

1012
57:34.780 --> 57:35.630
Nine, just fucking die.

1013
57:35.650 --> 57:36.340
Money that I lost doesn't compare

1014
57:36.360 --> 57:37.800
- That way, everything's over with. - to the time I lost being his fan.

1015
57:37.820 --> 57:39.310
Hey, how about we wait for Nine's statement first?

1016
57:39.330 --> 57:40.420
What fucking statement? He's already exposed!

1017
57:40.440 --> 57:41.390
If I were Wan,

1018
57:41.410 --> 57:42.690
- I would've pushed him myself - Expose yourself to the truth, jerk.

1019
57:42.710 --> 57:43.830
- before he could jump. - And the company is keeping him?

1020
57:43.850 --> 57:44.860
It's over, Nine. Stop wriggling out of it.

1021
57:44.900 --> 57:47.020
- Hope Nine gets psychiatric help. - Absolutely awful by nature.

1022
57:47.040 --> 57:48.840
- Where are Nine's mommies at? - Save the acting for your series,

1023
57:48.860 --> 57:50.730
- Do you know what a POS your baby is? - not your real life, bastard.

1024
57:50.750 --> 57:51.960
Poor Juno.

1025
57:51.980 --> 57:54.000
Serves you right. Talk about the consequences of your actions.

1026
57:54.020 --> 57:55.840
You're even more hated than I thought.

1027
57:56.110 --> 57:57.570
No need to bow to you.

1028
57:57.840 --> 57:58.840
My foot will do the job.

1029
57:58.990 --> 58:00.590
Stop destroying people's lives

1030
58:00.610 --> 58:02.640
because of your trauma!

1031
58:02.880 --> 58:04.560
All the bad things that happened...

1032
58:04.610 --> 58:05.830
You've done it all to yourself.

1033
58:05.850 --> 58:08.170
- Just say "Nine" to cuss someone out. - Hey, let me ask you this.

1034
58:08.870 --> 58:10.200
What the hell do you value?!

1035
58:11.420 --> 58:12.440
I wanna be an actor!

1036
58:12.700 --> 58:13.600
But why?

1037
58:13.880 --> 58:14.560
Well, I'll get to shine so bright.

1038
58:14.580 --> 58:16.540
Please put your hands together for Nine, Nopphanat Wongwiboon,

1039
58:16.560 --> 58:19.020
this year's 'Rising Star,'

1040
58:19.040 --> 58:19.900
the absolute man of the hour.

1041
58:19.930 --> 58:21.560
Wherever I go, people will swarm around me, screaming

1042
58:21.590 --> 58:22.560
and taking photos.

1043
58:22.580 --> 58:23.610
"Argh, Nine, Nine, Nine, Nine!"

1044
58:23.650 --> 58:25.780
"Action equals reaction."

1045
58:25.800 --> 58:27.320
Damn it, so what do you want me to do?

1046
58:29.730 --> 58:31.000
Just fucking die, then.

1047
58:35.010 --> 58:36.170
Do you jerks have any damn clue...

1048
58:36.720 --> 58:38.320
how fucking hard it was

1049
58:38.370 --> 58:39.900
to make it here?!

1050
58:40.810 --> 58:42.510
Fuck, it wasn't easy at all!!

1051
58:43.600 --> 58:46.440
How many heads he has used as stepping stones.

1052
58:47.200 --> 58:48.520
Even if it's you, I have to do it.

1053
58:53.800 --> 58:55.100
Hey, I'm sorry.

1054
58:55.120 --> 58:56.720
Wan... I didn't mean to.

1055
59:02.960 --> 59:03.990
Is that it?

1056
59:04.010 --> 59:05.280
Is that what you want?

1057
01:00:11.320 --> 01:00:12.810
Falling from where I am might hurt,

1058
01:00:18.610 --> 01:00:19.920
but I won't be embarrassed.

1059
01:00:36.010 --> 01:00:37.760
I'm sure you can do it.

1060
01:00:38.200 --> 01:00:39.240
Thank you.

1061
01:00:39.510 --> 01:00:41.560
Then, excuse me.

1062
01:00:41.670 --> 01:00:42.920
Please don't go, Nine.

1063
01:00:47.850 --> 01:00:48.910
Believe me.

1064
01:00:51.310 --> 01:00:52.960
Even after this,

1065
01:00:53.310 --> 01:00:55.840
so many fans out there are still protecting you.

1066
01:00:57.150 --> 01:00:59.160
So many people out there still love you,

1067
01:01:01.360 --> 01:01:02.870
those who see you as their happiness.

1068
01:01:06.990 --> 01:01:08.460
Please don't go...

1069
01:01:11.910 --> 01:01:12.680
Nine!

1070
01:01:14.170 --> 01:01:14.900
Nine!

1071
01:01:14.920 --> 01:01:15.410
Nine, baby!!

1072
01:01:15.430 --> 01:01:16.030
Wan!

1073
01:01:16.050 --> 01:01:17.040
Grab him.

1074
01:01:20.740 --> 01:01:21.520
Nine...

1075
01:01:33.510 --> 01:01:34.510
I'm sorry

1076
01:01:39.830 --> 01:01:41.680
that I raised you this way.

1077
01:01:44.720 --> 01:01:47.480
I should've cared more about you guys.

1078
01:01:53.700 --> 01:01:55.480
Nine, please don't go.

1079
01:02:01.100 --> 01:02:02.310
Stay with me.

1080
01:02:05.000 --> 01:02:06.320
Don't go...

1081
01:02:06.800 --> 01:02:08.160
Please stay with me...

1082
01:02:10.980 --> 01:02:11.980
Get down.

1083
01:02:13.620 --> 01:02:16.670
♫So why would I yield?♫

1084
01:02:17.120 --> 01:02:18.120
Get down, Nine.

1085
01:02:19.870 --> 01:02:23.400
♫Over my dead body, I'd never yield♫

1086
01:02:23.420 --> 01:02:26.920
♫I'd accept nothing♫

1087
01:02:26.940 --> 01:02:30.540
♫If it means I'm losing♫

1088
01:02:30.560 --> 01:02:34.080
♫I've given it all up till I had no one♫

1089
01:02:34.100 --> 01:02:40.600
♫Are you dreaming, thinking I'd yield at once?♫

1090
01:02:40.750 --> 01:02:42.280
Why would you do this?

1091
01:02:49.290 --> 01:02:51.270
Don't you feel bad for me, Nine?

1092
01:02:52.800 --> 01:02:55.160
You don't have to love anyone, but can you just love yourself?

1093
01:03:11.110 --> 01:03:13.320
Is there anyone who still loves me, Mama?

1094
01:03:18.330 --> 01:03:19.400
I do.

1095
01:03:21.310 --> 01:03:22.760
I do, you fucking bastard.

1096
01:03:23.220 --> 01:03:24.220
I love you.

1097
01:03:33.600 --> 01:03:34.360
Nine...

1098
01:03:34.800 --> 01:03:35.560
Nine.

1099
01:03:42.220 --> 01:03:43.500
Anything you did wrong,

1100
01:03:44.550 --> 01:03:46.030
make it right.

1101
01:03:49.720 --> 01:03:51.760
Take responsibility for what you did.

1102
01:03:54.500 --> 01:03:55.640
Start over.

1103
01:04:03.640 --> 01:04:04.700
Do you hear me?

1104
01:04:10.610 --> 01:04:11.800
Come on, put something on.

1105
01:04:14.830 --> 01:04:16.280
What would you do if you caught a cold?

1106
01:04:19.420 --> 01:04:20.400
Are you cold?

1107
01:04:21.420 --> 01:04:22.280
Mama...

1108
01:04:25.200 --> 01:04:26.200
Thank...

1109
01:04:28.340 --> 01:04:30.720
Thank you for loving me...

1110
01:04:33.020 --> 01:04:34.280
Do this again

1111
01:04:35.210 --> 01:04:36.440
and I'll hit you.

1112
01:04:36.590 --> 01:04:38.600
I'll hit you to death, you hear me?

1113
01:04:49.750 --> 01:04:50.960
Thank you, Wan.

1114
01:04:52.730 --> 01:04:53.830
Truly, thank you.

1115
01:05:50.270 --> 01:05:51.220
What happened?

1116
01:05:52.010 --> 01:05:53.120
Why are you here?

1117
01:05:55.350 --> 01:05:56.510
You're okay, right?

1118
01:06:01.810 --> 01:06:03.280
It's over now, Wan.

1119
01:06:05.260 --> 01:06:06.010
Mm...

1120
01:06:07.490 --> 01:06:08.780
It really is over.

1121
01:06:16.410 --> 01:06:17.220
You know?

1122
01:06:19.850 --> 01:06:21.080
I ended up here

1123
01:06:23.200 --> 01:06:24.760
because Nine was about to jump off the building.

1124
01:07:02.100 --> 01:07:03.280
Is this it, Third?

1125
01:07:06.480 --> 01:07:07.960
Is this what we wanted?

1126
01:07:29.040 --> 01:07:32.610
[OnetoNine (Rest)]

1127
01:07:35.600 --> 01:07:37.720
[OnetoNine (Closed)]

1128
01:07:47.100 --> 01:07:48.280
Hi, girlie.

1129
01:07:48.510 --> 01:07:49.580
Oh, girlie.

1130
01:07:49.600 --> 01:07:51.720
I'm here to ask you to come audition for a series.

1131
01:07:53.680 --> 01:07:55.520
If you can't get it sorted, just quit!

1132
01:07:55.590 --> 01:07:57.840
Do not let your emotions take over during work,

1133
01:07:57.860 --> 01:07:59.780
or you'd never be able to win against Wut.

1134
01:07:59.800 --> 01:08:01.240
Go talk it over.

1135
01:08:01.640 --> 01:08:03.080
I'm glad you came today.

1136
01:08:03.480 --> 01:08:04.480
Winning my heart

1137
01:08:04.940 --> 01:08:05.790
isn't easy.

1138
01:08:05.810 --> 01:08:07.440
Wan, are you finally awake?!

1139
01:08:07.520 --> 01:08:08.520
I already told my mom

1140
01:08:08.610 --> 01:08:09.520
that you were my boyfriend.

1141
01:08:09.690 --> 01:08:11.360
I haven't even said yes.

1142
01:08:11.380 --> 01:08:12.380
Will you be my boyfriend?

1143
01:08:30.979 --> 01:08:33.960
♫Everything I've ever wanted,♫

1144
01:08:33.979 --> 01:08:38.000
♫I've traded it all with tears♫

1145
01:08:38.020 --> 01:08:42.220
♫I don't care how people see it♫

1146
01:08:43.520 --> 01:08:46.620
♫Being at the top is the reason I'm here♫

1147
01:08:46.640 --> 01:08:50.720
♫I don't care whose heads I have to step over♫

1148
01:08:50.740 --> 01:08:52.250
♫For my longing,♫

1149
01:08:52.270 --> 01:08:55.319
♫I'm ready to sacrifice everything♫

1150
01:08:55.520 --> 01:08:58.660
♫Enraged by those who never look my way,♫

1151
01:08:58.680 --> 01:09:01.620
♫Hatred brims 'cause they never care anyway♫

1152
01:09:01.640 --> 01:09:03.740
♫I'm willing to make sacrifices,♫

1153
01:09:03.760 --> 01:09:05.859
♫So why am I the one who loses this time?♫

1154
01:09:05.880 --> 01:09:08.930
♫I laid down my life for it♫

1155
01:09:08.950 --> 01:09:12.080
♫So why would I yield?♫

1156
01:09:12.100 --> 01:09:15.300
♫Laid down my life for it♫

1157
01:09:15.319 --> 01:09:18.779
♫Over my dead body, I'd never yield♫

1158
01:09:18.800 --> 01:09:22.420
♫I'd accept nothing♫

1159
01:09:22.439 --> 01:09:25.939
♫If it means I'm losing♫

1160
01:09:25.960 --> 01:09:29.510
♫I've given it all up till I had no one♫

1161
01:09:29.529 --> 01:09:35.819
♫Are you dreaming, thinking I'd yield at once?♫

1162
01:09:36.189 --> 01:09:39.380
♫If this is how it unfolds,♫

1163
01:09:39.410 --> 01:09:44.540
♫I'd rather disappear forever♫

1164
01:09:44.560 --> 01:09:46.729
♫If I had to surrender,♫

1165
01:09:47.240 --> 01:09:50.550
♫Wouldn't you say it was absurd?♫

1166
01:09:50.830 --> 01:09:53.920
♫If this is how I lose, I lose,♫

1167
01:09:53.939 --> 01:09:59.360
♫I'd rather die, I would♫

1168
01:10:04.560 --> 01:10:09.360
[Mr. Fanboy Series]
